{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931300/extras/58e0a5683beb09670d0003ca3a5854ff.avif?t=1759866832\" width=780 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the age of hysteria, where a confused doctor finds himself in the confines of an asylum riddled with monsters of an unknown world. As you navigate through the abandoned and filthy rooms of the institute to unravel the asylum's tragic secrets, piercing together fragmented memories and disturbing documents, the succubi lurk in the shadows, testing your willpower and sanity. Resist their temptations to uncover the mysteries surrounding the institute - and yourself... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>...or succumb to the darkness within.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931300/extras/6a26dd1b48262f3aa272f9a6c68c9125.avif?t=1759866832\" width=780 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cycle of Corruption</strong> is an erotic horror adventure game where you will have to complete your mission and unravel the mystery surrounding the asylum, all the while trying to avoid the deadly succubi roaming the facility. Some of them will kill you on the spot, some may play around with you and some may even seem friendly... but the bottom line is, you can never trust a single attractive female in this area, so if you encounter one, there's only one sensible thing you can do: run!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While exploring, you will have to complete several puzzles obstructing your way forward and collect tidbits of information that will help you uncover just what on Earth has happened to the institute, and most importantly - about yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931300/extras/4cfd9f29b0f7e6df96c86a3a8cf17c59.avif?t=1759866832\" width=780 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cycle of Corruption</strong> Demo gives you a preview of what the full version offers, namely:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A creepy, abandoned asylum full of <strong>mystery, puzzles and secrets</strong> waiting for you to explore.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Evade, struggle against or hide</strong> from the dangerous succubi roaming around. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 unique handcrafted, <strong>high quality and super sexy pixel animations</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Voice acting</strong> for all characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A taste of <strong>three of the main girls</strong> that each have their stories and unique areas in the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vibrating smart toy integration</strong> through Intiface.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Difficulty selection</strong> for additional challenges.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3931300?t=1759866832","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3931300?t=1759866832","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931300/983819a66f77350e385dcd74aeb61a469554509e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759866832","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931300/983819a66f77350e385dcd74aeb61a469554509e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759866832","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id